<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">Mark your attendance</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, thank you for volunteering at <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> on {{eventDate}} at {{eventTime}}, {{location}}.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Please use your personal link below to confirm whether you attended, log your hours, and optionally attach up to two photos from the session.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;"><a href="{{link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2691D0,#1B6EA0);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;">🔗 Mark my attendance</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5E6E7E;font-size:13px;">This link is unique to you, needs no login, and stays active for {{linkTtlDays}} days. Photo uploads are optional.</p>
